{"id":"n77973-1-13","stage":5,"title":"철거 · 拆迁","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77973-1-13-1","ko":"길거리에 있던 포장마차가 없어졌네?","zh":"街上的那个摊位不见了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길거리에","meaning":"大街，街头，马路","explanation":"길거리：大街，街头，马路；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길거리","audio":"/audio/86c04676580d73caed6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43877","senseId":"1","lemma":"길거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길거리에","audio":"/audio/46a440306427b7787003.mp3"}},{"text":"있던","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던","audio":"/audio/abc85abdfa55b1e0bc82.mp3"}},{"text":"포장마차가","meaning":"流动小吃摊，手推车小吃摊，大排档","explanation":"포장마차：流动小吃摊，手推车小吃摊，大排档；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"포장마차","audio":"/audio/bee714e3c6348f06188f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84692","senseId":"1","lemma":"포장마차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포장마차가","audio":"/audio/797a0144a78ac1853614.mp3"}},{"text":"없어졌네?","meaning":"不见了、消失了","explanation":"없다：不在、没有了（없어지다：消失）；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어졌네","audio":"/audio/831a2a63998d720334a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86c04676580d73ca","term":"길거리","zh":"大街，街头，马路","audio":"/audio/86c04676580d73caed6d.mp3","entryId":"43877","definition":"供人或车马通行的道路。","pronunciation":["길꺼리"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"bee714e3c6348f06","term":"포장마차","zh":"流动小吃摊，手推车小吃摊，大排档","audio":"/audio/bee714e3c6348f06188f.mp3","entryId":"84692","definition":"手推车等上立四根柱子，再用塑料套在其上的流动餐车，出售一些简便的食物及酒水。","pronunciation":["포장마차"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在、没有了（없어지다：消失）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不在、没有了（없어지다：消失）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8f964a1da9269dadf6e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77973-1-13-2","ko":"철거를 하고 시장 안의 가게로 옮겼대.","zh":"听说它被拆了，搬去市场里的店铺里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"철거를","meaning":"拆迁，拆除","explanation":"철거：拆迁，拆除；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"철거","audio":"/audio/8a70e8900c84a96a0f37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77973","senseId":"1","lemma":"철거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"철거를","audio":"/audio/fb1fca5fda50635c0a93.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做、进行（철거를 하다：拆除）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（철거를 하다：拆除）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"시장","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}},{"text":"안의","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안의","audio":"/audio/bc056b4867b0f95665cb.mp3"}},{"text":"가게로","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게로","audio":"/audio/451619e48777afbd16d2.mp3"}},{"text":"옮겼대.","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮겼대","audio":"/audio/ea7e532d5556d25486e2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a70e8900c84a96a","term":"철거","zh":"拆迁，拆除","audio":"/audio/8a70e8900c84a96a0f37.mp3","entryId":"77973","definition":"毁掉或拆掉建筑物、设施等。","pronunciation":["철거"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（철거를 하다：拆除）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（철거를 하다：拆除）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/85f7ff958b0fc7c37731.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.304,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77973","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典",